OL,3,GNEWSAMisogyny and unwanted contact
OL,4,A'common' for DJ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA DJ has said she has frequently
OL,7,Fencountered misogyny and unwelcome
OL,8,Fphysical contact while working.
OL,10,FMelissa Carver, known professionally as
OL,11,FDJ Mel and based in Jersey, said she
OL,12,Fhad experienced a variety of negative
OL,13,Freactions due to her being a woman in
OL,14,Fher career.
OL,16,FShe said some clients had called her
OL,17,Fand asked why she and "not the DJ" had
OL,18,Fresponded, and other instances had seen
OL,19,Fher arrived at booked venues to be
OL,20,Fasked where the DJ was.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
